{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50840","headline":"绿阴亭 · 卢肇","name":"绿阴亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亭边古木昼阴阴，亭下寒潭百丈深。\n黄菊近连陶令宅，青山遥负（一作「偿」）向平心。\n人归别浦村烟敛，鱼跃澄波槛水沈。\n更爱玉琴调惠政，爲君登此一开襟。\n（按《全唐诗》止有前四句，今从《临江府志》录全。\n）（《全唐诗续补遗》卷十据《隆庆临江府志》卷十三收此诗，题下注：「在新喻县右，俯临袁江。\n」「亭边」作「亭间」，「百丈」作「百尺」，「近连」作「旧连」，「向平」作「子平」，「槛水」作「槛影」。\n今删彼存此。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢肇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}